rust any adult  with that especially not government  workers in a government  in the government school system  yeah i'm not gonna i'm not gonna entrust  government employees  to  physically punish my child no  this is the conundrum then that you deal  with uh the lacks discipline doesn't  work  but harsher discipline requires a  certain amount of trust between school  and parent and that trust doesn't exist  and largely that's the fault of the  schools because they've destroyed all  that trust  [Music]  so what's the answer  well i'll tell you what the answer is  get your kid out of the public school  system that's the answer  well if you enjoyed that video be sure  to hit the subscribe button and ring the  bell to get more content like it if  you're craving more content go watch or  listen to my full show at dailywire.com  spotify or wherever you get your podcast

